{"name":"Overgrown Citadel","hex":"#888844","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"overgrown","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having large numbers of plants which have become too big, and are hence spoiling the picturesqueness of a garden.","Having grown bigger without developing maturity or changing character."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["past participle of overgrow"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/overgrown"},{"term":"citadel","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A strong fortress that sits high above a city.","A stronghold or fortified place."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/citadel"}],"entries":[{"title":"Overgrown","blocks":[{"text":"Overgrown is the second studio album by English singer-songwriter James Blake. It was released on 5 April 2013 by Blake's Atlas Records, along with Republic Records and Polydor Records. The album features guest appearances from Wu-Tang Clan member RZA and English musician Brian Eno. Overgrown debuted at number eight on the UK Albums Chart and at number one on the US Dance/Electronic chart. It was supported by lead single \"Retrograde\"."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/de/James_Blake_-_Overgrown_album_cover.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Overgrown","wikidata":"Q7113670"},{"title":"Citadel","blocks":[{"text":"A citadel is the most fortified area of a town or city. It may be a castle, fortress, or fortified center. The term is a diminutive of city, meaning \"little city\", because it is a smaller part of the city of which it is the defensive core."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Casale_Monferrato_map_%28018_003%29.jpg/330px-Casale_Monferrato_map_%28018_003%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Citadel","wikidata":"Q88291"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Bibracte_Porte_Rebout.jpg/500px-Bibracte_Porte_Rebout.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Bibracte_Porte_Rebout.jpg/500px-Bibracte_Porte_Rebout.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Reconstruction of the redoubt of Bibracte, a part of the Gaulish oppidum. The Celts utilized these fortified cities in the 2nd and 1st centuries BC.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABibracte_Porte_Rebout.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Si%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg/500px-Si%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Si%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg/1280px-Si%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Si%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg/500px-Si%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Although much of Nice was ransacked during the 1543 siege of the city, Franco-Ottoman forces besieging Nice were unable to capture its Citadel. Citadels have often been used as a last defence for a besieged army.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASi%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Royal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-Royal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Royal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg/1280px-Royal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Royal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-Royal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Royal 22nd Regiment's home garrison is the Citadelle of Quebec in Canada. The citadel is the largest still in military operation in North America.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARoyal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/USS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg/500px-USS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/USS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg/1280px-USS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/USS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg/500px-USS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Entrance to the armoured citadel of USS New Jersey","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUSS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg"}],"sounds":{"overgrown":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-overgrown.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c5/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-overgrown.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-overgrown.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c5/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-overgrown.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-overgrown.wav.ogg"}],"citadel":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/En-us-citadel.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest